# CTRLO-OTHER-PICKERS round 3: /model's menu (the model scenario's catalog
# and profiles) with a search typed, then Ctrl-O and an edit key in one
# burst (`key -H`, one send-keys).
# `o`, C-a: the search `o`, the caret before it; Down moves the mark
# (`typed`).
# Ctrl-O and C-j: the composer's insert_newline adds nothing while /model's
# menu is up (app_input_runtime.zig:514@481104fd), so nothing moves
# (`burst-cj`).
# Ctrl-O and C-k: a kill of the `o`, which syncs the menu
# (delete_to_line_end, app_input_runtime.zig:479-488, :485): the search is
# empty and the mark back on the first row (`burst-ck`).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models models.json
fx: seed model-seed-fx.json
xfx: seed model-seed-xfx.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type /model
key Enter
wait 1.5
type o
key C-a
wait 0.4
key Down
wait 0.5
snap typed
key -H 0f 0a
wait 0.8
snap burst-cj
key -H 0f 0b
wait 0.8
snap burst-ck
